data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"group\": {\n      \"platform\": \"facebook\",\n      \"id\": \"276115116155772\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/276115116155772\",\n      \"name\": \"Coaching Softball - Tips, Drills, Travel teams, and More\",\n      \"description\": \"Please feel free to ask and discuss any questions related to Softball - particularly tips, drills,coaching styles, training aids, and travel teams.  If it's Softball - especially youth & High School softball - we want to hear about it. I will respond as time permits. Submit your favorite Softball photos or video clips. Sky's the limit! Pass the word around and let's talk Softball. All members are encouraged to share their ideas and viewpoints, but let's keep the critiques civil. Remember, this site is for youth players as well as parents & coaches to have a positive experience. Everyone is at a different playing level & coaching level. There are no dumb questions here. Some of you veteran coaches can be a \\\"Know it all\\\". Please check your ego at the door when you come into our forum. Remember, we were all new at one time.\\n\\n*Not Permitted - You will be deleted (zero tolerance) without warning from the group if the following occurs or unless we decide otherwise:\\n- No name calling\\n- No Badgering\\n- No bullying\\n- No foul language\\n- No Negativity - Constructive Criticism only\\n- No posting Nudity\\n- No Racism posted\\n- No Hate Posted\\n- No directing members to other fb groups with an agenda\\n- No Advertising your Personal Business - This is a information site to help other coaches & players.\\n- No selling Merchandise or Services (if you join this group to just sell, sell, sell, you will be deleted and banned without warning).\\n- No Raffels.\\n\\nNote: If you would like to promote your business that is sports related on the site, then please ask one of the Administrators first. We will determine whether it is beneficial or appropriate to the group before authorized. If you don't ask first, you will be deleted from the group without warning. We are trying to make this a forum of information, and not a swap meet.\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2017-02-21T18:08:21.000Z\",\n      \"historySummary\": \"Group created on February 21, 2017. Name last changed on December 19, 2023.\",\n      \"privacy\": {\n        \"label\": \"Public\",\n        \"description\": \"Anyone can see who's in the group and what they post.\"\n      },\n      \"visibility\": {\n        \"label\": \"Visible\",\n        \"description\": \"Anyone can find this group.\"\n      },\n      \"categories\": [],\n      \"memberCount\": 205130,\n      \"administratorCount\": 1,\n      \"moderatorCount\": 5,\n      \"administrators\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1047192256\",\n          \"name\": \"Mike Zimmer\",\n          \"url\": null,\n          \"profilePictureUrl\": \"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/600252168_10236273653195292_5093459529439754077_n.jpg?stp=c43.0.638.638a_cp0_dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx638x638&ctp=s32x32&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=1d2534&_nc_ohc=Ko9cSMwQrwUQ7kNvwF0VqGV&_nc_oc=Adqwh7sdBIXOybJwYbMtfq5oc2XhC_eCw-CY6ABkc75PIsAir_WsP_WKSsvS-RmnpYQ&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.xx&_nc_gid=zlEYBNmqwoqEOgdIKaxMYA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQSpl2A4brcLgRWh_nvrF2SR1RKXj_HdbjG9uDuUVdU9lA&oe=6AF3EB21\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"moderators\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"pfbid0P9dYpkB13jaRfvPz69AS4oZAQ4G7KM3Zcn11H5fsnwr6J7CijkepHmDq12PYgkKzl\",\n          \"name\": \"Maria Fernicola\",\n          \"url\": null,\n          \"profilePictureUrl\": \"https://scontent-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/234387466_2984652465137383_3285655304941930138_n.jpg?stp=cp0_dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1284x1284&ctp=s32x32&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=e99d92&_nc_ohc=sIr01dq1w1sQ7kNvwFzFbkF&_nc_oc=AdrHOeHGj6NcroOmp4RRzd1MeVn28KHsGAjBK0MYW5Njd0Hh0ShuTrLEbaUVnMSSx3c&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1